WEBVTT

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
Les Misérables

00:07.730 --> 00:12.150
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.690 --> 00:11.690
Beyond the wind

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
The wind blows

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
I held my knees

00:22.160 --> 00:25.790
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.790 --> 00:31.210
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Far away, very far away

00:31.210 --> 00:35.010
Tooku haruka tooku

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
A gentle voice is calling me

00:35.010 --> 00:41.600
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Let's go look for it

00:41.600 --> 00:45.190
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.190 --> 00:50.940
Attemonai keredo

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
The rain comes down

00:50.940 --> 00:55.740
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.740 --> 01:00.450
on a lonely morning

00:55.740 --> 01:00.450
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.450 --> 01:05.000
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.450 --> 01:05.000
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
the sunlight is peering at us

01:05.000 --> 01:09.590
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Wipe away your tears

01:09.590 --> 01:11.960
Namida fuite

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Look forward

01:11.960 --> 01:14.880
Mae wo muite

01:14.880 --> 01:19.220
and summon all of your strength

01:14.880 --> 01:19.220
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.220 --> 01:21.560
Let's walk

01:19.220 --> 01:21.560
Aruite yukou

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.560 --> 01:23.930
Kitto yukeru

01:23.930 --> 01:31.270
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.930 --> 01:31.270
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.270 --> 01:34.320
forever...

01:31.270 --> 01:33.690
Dokomademo

01:52.510 --> 01:53.660
Stop it!

01:53.680 --> 01:55.080
I haven't done anything wrong!

01:55.520 --> 01:58.330
Let me go!

02:00.360 --> 02:01.750
Inspector Javert...

02:01.770 --> 02:03.710
What has this woman done?

02:03.730 --> 02:04.800
Look over there.

02:05.610 --> 02:08.300
That woman attacked those two with a stick.

02:08.320 --> 02:09.760
She couldn't have...

02:09.780 --> 02:12.350
I don't believe she would do such a thing.

02:12.370 --> 02:13.220
She must have had a good reason.

02:13.660 --> 02:17.480
That woman has attacked these two gentlemen with a stick.

02:17.500 --> 02:19.940
It is only natural that she should be arrested.

02:19.960 --> 02:21.350
But...

02:22.540 --> 02:24.730
Did anyone see what happened?

02:24.740 --> 02:29.750
Thenardier's Malice

02:31.350 --> 02:33.870
Inspector Javert, please listen to me!

02:34.180 --> 02:36.240
I didn't do anything wrong, it was they, who...

02:36.270 --> 02:36.870
No...

02:37.270 --> 02:41.210
Those gentlemen put snow down my back all of a sudden.

02:41.230 --> 02:43.250
Take this woman to prison!

02:43.610 --> 02:45.670
To prison? No...

02:46.360 --> 02:48.550
You will sentenced for six months.

02:50.320 --> 02:52.010
Six months in prison...

02:52.030 --> 02:54.890
I won't be able to send Cosette money!

02:54.910 --> 02:58.020
Have mercy, inspector! It wasn't my fault...

02:58.040 --> 02:58.890
No...

02:58.910 --> 03:00.310
I am to blame!

03:00.750 --> 03:02.440
I will apologize to them.

03:02.460 --> 03:05.770
If he wishes to to put more snow down my back, I will let him!

03:05.800 --> 03:07.320
But, please do not send me to prison!

03:07.340 --> 03:08.360
Not prison...

03:08.380 --> 03:09.820
Is that all you wish to say?

03:11.430 --> 03:12.570
Take her away!

03:13.800 --> 03:15.490
Please wait!

03:16.220 --> 03:17.240
A moment of your time, Javert.

03:19.270 --> 03:20.220
Mayor Madeleine!

03:20.850 --> 03:22.540
It's all your fault!

03:22.560 --> 03:23.330
Because of you...!

03:24.440 --> 03:25.420
Hey, you!

03:25.440 --> 03:26.710
Do not show disrespect!

03:27.400 --> 03:28.840
Inspector Javert.

03:28.860 --> 03:31.220
You've done your duty, let her be.

03:32.780 --> 03:34.260
Let me be?

03:34.280 --> 03:36.050
I can go home, right?

03:36.080 --> 03:37.640
Who said that?

03:37.660 --> 03:40.020
That's not something the cold-hearted mayor would say.

03:40.580 --> 03:42.310
Who said it?

03:42.790 --> 03:44.980
But, Mayor Madeleine...

03:45.540 --> 03:49.070
I ordered you to release this woman.

03:49.510 --> 03:51.440
I cannot do that.

03:51.470 --> 03:54.410
This woman is a criminal who attacked two gentlemen.

03:55.100 --> 03:56.740
It must be a misunderstanding.

03:57.260 --> 04:02.910
My subordinate has asked several witnesses in the street.

04:02.940 --> 04:09.380
The result of his investigation is that those two men
should be punished for putting snow down her back.

04:09.400 --> 04:14.260
However, this woman has just attacked two gentlemen with a stick.

04:14.950 --> 04:19.140
She acted with good reason.

04:20.790 --> 04:22.850
But, Mayor Madeleine,

04:22.870 --> 04:28.480
Under my jurisdiction as police inspector, I have decided to arrest this woman.

04:28.880 --> 04:35.910
According to the criminal code of justice, the mayor
has the jurisdiction to reverse such a decision.

04:37.260 --> 04:38.840
However...

04:38.850 --> 04:41.700
I am taking this woman into my custody.

04:43.020 --> 04:44.750
I can leave...

04:46.690 --> 04:48.210
She has a terrible fever.

04:57.070 --> 04:58.220
<i>Why?</i>

04:58.650 --> 05:01.320
<i>Why does he go out of his way to defend a criminal?</i>

05:01.660 --> 05:03.390
<i>It must be because he too...</i>

05:05.000 --> 05:06.440
<i>...is a criminal.</i>

05:12.880 --> 05:16.860
<i>To  Monsieur Chabouillet, Secretary of the Paris Prefect of Police,</i>

05:17.220 --> 05:27.790
<i>I have reason to believe that Mayor Madeleine
is in fact the escaped convict, Jean Valjean.</i>

05:27.810 --> 05:30.420
<i>I request a thorough investigation into this matter.</i>

05:30.820 --> 05:32.800
<i>I know it is him...</i>

05:33.320 --> 05:35.420
<i>Even if he appears to be an honest man,</i>

05:35.450 --> 05:38.400
<i>Men, like he, can never change.</i>

05:39.320 --> 05:42.560
<i>There is no doubt in my mind that he is plotting something.</i>

05:48.210 --> 05:49.810
How is she, doctor?

05:49.830 --> 05:53.980
I hate to be the bearer of bad news, but unfortunately
she doesn't have long to live.

05:55.130 --> 05:58.570
Her fever has subsided for the time being.

05:58.590 --> 06:02.090
She should remain stable for a while.

06:02.100 --> 06:04.330
However, eventually, she will...

06:04.720 --> 06:05.910
Cosette!

06:05.930 --> 06:08.540
Cosette... Cosette!

06:11.020 --> 06:14.000
Is that the name of your child?

06:18.200 --> 06:19.970
<i>Cosette!</i>

06:23.990 --> 06:25.470
What are you doing?

06:25.500 --> 06:27.140
Don't slack off!

06:27.460 --> 06:29.060
I'm done cleaning.

06:29.460 --> 06:32.310
You still have to clean outside!

06:32.340 --> 06:33.270
At this hour?

06:36.090 --> 06:37.280
Look!

06:37.300 --> 06:39.700
There's a ton of leaves on the ground!

06:40.010 --> 06:42.820
But with the wind blowing like this, no matter how many times I sweep...

06:42.850 --> 06:43.950
Don't talk back!

06:44.890 --> 06:47.330
And, when you re finished sweeping, Cosette,

06:47.350 --> 06:49.290
You can go to bed without dinner, tonight.

06:49.310 --> 06:51.890
If you're going to blame someone, blame your mother.

06:51.900 --> 06:55.340
It's her fault, since she hasn't sent us any money lately!

06:55.360 --> 06:56.550
My mother...

06:56.570 --> 06:57.800
I'm cold, Mom...

06:58.320 --> 07:00.970
I'm sorry, Éponine!

07:00.990 --> 07:04.090
You better not slack off, Cosette!

07:08.660 --> 07:10.140
Dammit!

07:10.170 --> 07:13.020
What is that Fantine thinking?!

07:13.340 --> 07:15.900
She's such a bad mother!

07:15.920 --> 07:18.360
To leave her useless daughter with us!

07:19.880 --> 07:21.950
I don't think so...

07:21.970 --> 07:23.240
What are you doing?!

07:23.260 --> 07:25.200
You're going to give food to Cosette, aren't you?

07:25.720 --> 07:27.240
Gavroche!

07:27.270 --> 07:29.160
I've got work for you to do, today!

07:29.180 --> 07:30.540
Let me go!

07:30.560 --> 07:31.500
What are you doing?

07:31.520 --> 07:32.710
I said, let go!

07:32.730 --> 07:34.380
Let me go!

07:47.200 --> 07:48.140
Chou Chou!

07:51.620 --> 07:54.440
Come for me soon, Mother!

07:55.500 --> 07:57.080
<i>Mother!</i>

08:00.260 --> 08:01.900
She's awake...

08:02.680 --> 08:04.660
Forgive me, Fantine.

08:04.680 --> 08:07.910
It is my fault that you are suffering like this.

08:08.850 --> 08:11.500
Cosette is the name of your daughter, isn't it?

08:13.400 --> 08:17.920
I will send someone for her at once, so that the
two of you can live together in this town.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.710
Cosette?!

08:19.730 --> 08:22.170
You will allow Cosette to live with me?!

08:24.030 --> 08:26.590
But, what about the money I owe the Thénardiers?

08:26.910 --> 08:28.260
Don't worry about that.

08:28.280 --> 08:29.720
I will pay them.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.560
Of course, I will pay for your living expenses as well.

08:33.830 --> 08:34.940
Um...

08:35.580 --> 08:40.480
You just focus on regaining your strength and living happily with Cosette.

08:43.970 --> 08:46.820
You are being so kind to me, yet, I...

08:46.850 --> 08:49.580
Forgive me!

08:49.970 --> 08:51.160
No.

08:51.180 --> 08:53.620
I should apologize to you.

08:55.810 --> 08:57.640
Also...

08:57.650 --> 09:00.380
There is another person who wishes to apologize.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.630
Madame Meille?

09:06.030 --> 09:08.220
Forgive me, Fantine.

09:08.240 --> 09:10.850
I don't know how to atone for what I have done.

09:10.870 --> 09:13.640
I didn't want trouble at the factory,

09:13.660 --> 09:17.160
so I sent you away without listening to your story.

09:17.630 --> 09:19.150
Forgive me.

09:19.170 --> 09:20.830
Please, forgive me.

09:20.840 --> 09:22.900
It's all right.

09:22.920 --> 09:25.320
I will be able to live with Cosette!

09:25.840 --> 09:27.280
Fantine!

09:27.300 --> 09:28.280
Thank you!

09:29.100 --> 09:32.450
Where is Cosette now?

09:32.770 --> 09:36.410
At an inn called the Sergeant of Waterloo in Montfermeil.

09:36.440 --> 09:38.330
Montfermeil?

09:38.350 --> 09:40.460
It will take two days to go there and return.

09:42.030 --> 09:43.210
Alain.

09:43.230 --> 09:45.300
Can you leave immediately?

09:45.570 --> 09:51.220
Well... I have to stay at the orphanage for the Christmas preparations.

09:51.660 --> 09:52.930
I see...

09:52.950 --> 09:54.930
In this case, someone else will have to go.

09:54.950 --> 09:56.230
Umm...

09:56.250 --> 09:59.190
If you don't mind, may I go?

10:00.420 --> 10:02.190
I am counting on you, Madame Meille.

10:03.050 --> 10:03.900
Yes!

10:04.300 --> 10:05.780
Thank you very much!

10:05.790 --> 10:06.620
Madame Meille!

10:07.010 --> 10:09.320
It's the least I can do to atone for what I have done.

10:09.800 --> 10:12.950
We'll be together soon, Cosette!

10:46.970 --> 10:48.440
Good afternoon.

10:48.470 --> 10:49.610
Excuse me...

10:50.010 --> 10:51.170
Yes!

10:51.180 --> 10:52.630
Welcome!

10:54.890 --> 10:56.410
Will you be staying?

10:56.430 --> 10:57.580
No.

10:57.600 --> 11:02.420
Actually, I have come for Cosette who has been placed in your care.

11:02.900 --> 11:04.210
Cosette?

11:04.650 --> 11:08.090
Thank you for taking care of her for so long.

11:08.110 --> 11:11.090
I am here to take her back to her mother.

11:11.490 --> 11:12.930
Cosette?

11:14.240 --> 11:15.600
This is great!

11:15.620 --> 11:19.560
I thought that woman was going to leave her here forever!

11:19.580 --> 11:20.640
Huh?

11:20.670 --> 11:23.060
Never mind, just a minute! Husband!

11:23.670 --> 11:24.770
Husband!

11:29.670 --> 11:30.650
Is that so?

11:30.680 --> 11:34.160
You've come all this way to take Cosette to Montreuil-sur-Mer?

11:34.600 --> 11:35.660
Yes.

11:35.680 --> 11:37.580
What's wrong?!

11:37.600 --> 11:39.260
We can finally get rid of Cosette!

11:39.270 --> 11:40.120
Huh?

11:41.100 --> 11:42.920
Oh, never mind!

11:42.940 --> 11:47.250
Nothing would make me happier than reuniting her with her mother.

11:48.070 --> 11:49.710
I'm not sure if you are aware of this, but...

11:50.490 --> 11:54.590
Fantine has not paid for her care, all of this time.

11:54.620 --> 12:00.850
The expenses for her medicine, clothing, and school have just been piling up.

12:02.250 --> 12:04.690
That's right! She hasn't paid for any of it!

12:05.080 --> 12:06.730
That's fine.

12:06.750 --> 12:09.820
I heard all about that from Fantine.

12:18.220 --> 12:21.500
It appears that she owes you 130 francs.

12:21.520 --> 12:24.670
However, in gratitude, she is prepared to pay 200 francs.

12:26.150 --> 12:27.630
200 francs?!

12:32.860 --> 12:34.220
That's wonderful!

12:34.820 --> 12:37.360
I will bring Cosette right away!

12:37.370 --> 12:38.550
Wait!

12:39.080 --> 12:41.140
You've forgotten about "that"!

12:41.790 --> 12:43.350
"That"?

12:43.370 --> 12:45.100
Yes, "that"!

12:45.120 --> 12:46.100
Let's see...

12:47.000 --> 12:50.230
The additional expense to cover Cosette's illness over the Summer!

12:50.710 --> 12:56.200
There's that expensive vase that she broke
and the fee for that portrait of Paris!

12:56.220 --> 12:58.280
Also...

12:58.300 --> 12:59.780
Yes, yes!

12:59.810 --> 13:02.540
We incurred many expenses!

13:02.930 --> 13:05.000
So, how much is the total?

13:07.310 --> 13:08.460
The total...?

13:11.190 --> 13:14.300
It amounts to about 530 francs.

13:14.700 --> 13:16.550
530 francs?!

13:16.990 --> 13:20.720
That's in addition to the 200 francs.

13:20.740 --> 13:22.430
What should I do?

13:22.450 --> 13:25.310
I didn't bring that much money.

13:25.330 --> 13:28.020
In that case, you will have to return at a later time.

13:28.460 --> 13:32.290
We will have to continue looking after Cosette for a while.

13:32.710 --> 13:33.780
But...

13:33.800 --> 13:37.170
The truth is, Fantine is very ill.

13:37.180 --> 13:40.910
I promise to send you the remaining 530 francs.

13:40.930 --> 13:44.410
Please let me take Cosette with me today.

13:44.430 --> 13:45.580
Please!

13:46.480 --> 13:48.790
We couldn't do such a thing!

13:49.150 --> 13:53.800
Besides, there's no proof that you're really here on Fantine's behalf!

13:54.240 --> 13:59.470
We can't just let some random person carry our precious little Cosette away!

13:59.780 --> 14:02.100
Yes, that's right!

14:02.490 --> 14:05.930
In that case, at least let me see Cosette.

14:06.870 --> 14:11.190
If I tell Fantine how she's doing, perhaps she can rest assured a little bit.

14:11.620 --> 14:12.870
<i>Oh no!</i>

14:12.880 --> 14:16.250
<i>If she finds out that we haven't been taking good
care of Cosette, everything will be ruined!</i>

14:16.920 --> 14:19.240
Bring Cosette.

14:19.260 --> 14:20.490
But...

14:21.470 --> 14:24.120
She's playing upstairs, right?

14:24.140 --> 14:25.540
Huh?

14:27.100 --> 14:29.000
Cosette is upstairs!

14:29.020 --> 14:30.790
Just a minute!

14:34.070 --> 14:36.550
No way! I won't pretend to be Cosette!

14:36.940 --> 14:40.300
Come on, just for a little bit!

14:40.320 --> 14:42.220
Not even for a second!

14:42.240 --> 14:44.430
Don't be that way, Éponine!

14:44.450 --> 14:45.680
No!

14:45.700 --> 14:46.520
I'll do it!

14:48.710 --> 14:50.690
I'm counting on you, Azelma!

14:51.540 --> 14:53.770
In exchange, I want baked sweets, an apple and candy.

14:53.800 --> 14:54.360
Huh?

14:54.750 --> 14:56.860
My reward for pretending to be Cosette.

14:58.130 --> 14:59.990
Fine, okay.

15:03.550 --> 15:05.490
Is that her?

15:05.970 --> 15:07.660
I am Cosette.

15:07.680 --> 15:12.500
The people who live here are very nice and kind to me.

15:12.810 --> 15:14.170
Yes, yes!

15:14.190 --> 15:16.210
You look quite healthy.

15:16.230 --> 15:19.420
You are clothed well also.

15:19.450 --> 15:22.680
I could tell right away by looking at that skirt.

15:23.200 --> 15:26.510
I will return as soon as possible with the rest of the money.

15:26.540 --> 15:29.890
Until then, please take care of Cosette.

15:29.910 --> 15:30.480
Yes!

15:30.500 --> 15:31.730
Of course!

15:36.500 --> 15:38.780
We'll be waiting for your return!

15:41.720 --> 15:45.410
<i>I must go back quickly and apprise Monsieur Madeleine.</i>

15:52.770 --> 15:54.960
200 francs!

15:54.980 --> 15:57.460
And soon, 530 more francs!

15:58.110 --> 16:00.760
That won't be the end of it either!

16:02.700 --> 16:06.510
I bet that woman found herself a rich husband!

16:06.530 --> 16:07.600
What a world!

16:08.040 --> 16:11.060
Our luck has finally changed, husband!

16:18.630 --> 16:20.400
<i>Mother...</i>

16:20.420 --> 16:22.570
<i>I wonder what you're doing right about now?</i>

16:26.470 --> 16:27.840
Really?

16:27.850 --> 16:29.370
I still owe that much?

16:29.850 --> 16:31.580
Do not worry.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.210
I will pay for everything.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.760
Why?

16:34.770 --> 16:36.670
Why are you doing all this for me?

16:37.150 --> 16:38.920
I have no reason.

16:39.280 --> 16:41.170
You are in need...

16:41.190 --> 16:43.840
and I am in a position to help you.

16:44.240 --> 16:45.510
That is all.

16:47.240 --> 16:49.600
Also, Fantine...

16:49.620 --> 16:51.470
I was able to see Cosette.

16:52.750 --> 16:54.940
She seems to be doing very well.

16:54.960 --> 16:58.270
She was wearing a warm-looking brown skirt.

16:58.290 --> 17:01.040
That's the skirt I sent her!

17:01.710 --> 17:05.240
She's wearing the skirt that I bought her.

17:05.640 --> 17:09.280
And she has recovered from her illness.

17:09.310 --> 17:10.490
Thank goodness!

17:10.970 --> 17:13.750
However, this man Thénardier...

17:13.770 --> 17:16.250
I don't think he will be easy to deal with.

17:17.190 --> 17:18.330
Fantine!

17:18.730 --> 17:21.250
This time, I shall go myself.

17:21.280 --> 17:24.090
But Monsieur Madeleine, you have urgent business to take care of.

17:24.570 --> 17:28.260
I plan to remain in my room and finish it all before the day is done.

17:28.620 --> 17:30.550
Also, Fantine...

17:30.580 --> 17:33.520
Please write a letter to the Thénardiers.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.520
A letter?

17:36.080 --> 17:39.060
Ask them to release Cosette into my custody.

17:39.090 --> 17:39.980
I will use that as proof.

17:41.090 --> 17:42.480
I understand.

17:42.960 --> 17:44.030
Alain.

17:44.050 --> 17:46.950
Prepare a stagecoach for me first thing in the morning.

17:47.340 --> 17:48.320
Yes!

17:49.890 --> 17:51.240
Well.

17:51.260 --> 17:53.330
I must return to work.

17:53.350 --> 17:54.330
Yes.

17:56.850 --> 17:59.890
Thank you very much!

18:17.120 --> 18:17.890
Enter.

18:26.050 --> 18:28.780
Pardon the intrusion while you are working.

18:29.550 --> 18:30.950
What is it?

18:31.300 --> 18:32.240
Actually...

18:33.010 --> 18:37.290
Someone has intentionally wronged you.

18:38.190 --> 18:41.750
He must be punished.

18:42.150 --> 18:44.210
Someone has wronged me?

18:44.230 --> 18:45.920
What are you talking about?

18:45.940 --> 18:47.480
Who is this person?

18:48.570 --> 18:49.690
It is me.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.720
Explain yourself.

18:53.120 --> 18:54.470
Mayor Madeleine,

18:54.490 --> 18:58.060
I denounced you to the Prefect of Police in Paris.

19:00.920 --> 19:02.310
Denounced?

19:02.790 --> 19:06.780
I reported that you were the escaped convict, Jean Valjean.

19:08.470 --> 19:12.700
Many years ago, I was the captain of the guards at a prison in Toulon.

19:13.470 --> 19:19.220
Somehow, my memory of Jean Valjean clearly resembled you.

19:19.690 --> 19:24.380
Also, I have been investigating you for quite a while.

19:24.400 --> 19:27.630
Finally, yesterday, I denounced you to the Prefect of Police.

19:27.650 --> 19:30.380
What did the Prefect have to say?

19:31.740 --> 19:33.840
He said that it was not possible.

19:35.030 --> 19:37.430
Were you content with his answer?

19:37.870 --> 19:39.890
I had no choice but to accept his reply.

19:40.920 --> 19:44.150
Because the real Jean Valjean has been captured.

19:47.000 --> 19:49.070
The real Jean Valjean?

19:49.090 --> 19:50.190
That is correct.

19:50.220 --> 19:52.990
He once lived in a village near Arras.

19:53.010 --> 19:57.580
This man, called Champmathieu, was captured trying to steal apples.

19:58.350 --> 20:01.830
He bore a strong resemblance to the convict of Toulon.

20:01.850 --> 20:04.080
And has been identified as Jean Valjean.

20:04.810 --> 20:06.790
Are you certain?

20:07.360 --> 20:11.730
All of the witnesses that have been summoned
have testified that he is Jean Valjean.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.930
That includes myself.

20:13.950 --> 20:16.050
You have met him, as well?

20:16.530 --> 20:17.600
Yes.

20:17.620 --> 20:20.600
Without a doubt, that man is Jean Valjean.

20:23.210 --> 20:26.650
I have been mistaken about you.

20:27.450 --> 20:33.120
If one of my subordinates had done the same, I would,
without a second thought, demand his resignation.

20:33.510 --> 20:39.580
Mayor Madeleine, I cannot forgive myself for convincing
myself that you were an escaped convict.

20:41.600 --> 20:43.080
That is why, Mayor Madeleine,

20:43.810 --> 20:45.960
I request that you relieve me of my duty.

20:46.560 --> 20:49.590
Is this man to receive a trial?

20:50.320 --> 20:51.460
Yes.

20:51.860 --> 20:55.760
Although stealing apples is not a great crime in itself,

20:55.780 --> 21:02.180
This man has broken parole and, long ago, stolen a coin from a young man.

21:02.710 --> 21:04.980
Without a doubt, he will receive a life-sentence.

21:05.460 --> 21:06.900
When will this trial be held?

21:08.210 --> 21:09.150
Tomorrow.

21:09.590 --> 21:10.520
<i>Tomorrow!</i>

21:10.920 --> 21:14.860
I plan to go to the courthouse in Arras in order to testify.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.570
I will return when it is over.

21:17.260 --> 21:19.590
Please prepare my dismissal.

21:21.100 --> 21:22.910
I will not relieve you of your duties.

21:25.480 --> 21:28.250
You are to continue your duties as inspector.

21:28.940 --> 21:30.420
I cannot allow that.

21:30.900 --> 21:33.670
You are faithful and professional.

21:34.450 --> 21:37.260
I want you to continue serving this community.

21:39.530 --> 21:41.510
I cannot accept your hand.

21:41.540 --> 21:43.640
I await your punishment.

21:59.350 --> 22:00.990
The trial is tomorrow.

22:01.970 --> 22:05.120
What shall I do?

22:13.560 --> 22:16.600
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.520 --> 22:20.770
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.520 --> 22:20.770
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.440 --> 22:24.820
I love you, Mother

22:21.440 --> 22:24.820
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.440 --> 22:29.280
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.440 --> 22:29.280
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.280 --> 22:32.660
My precious mother

22:29.280 --> 22:32.660
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.450 --> 22:36.540
As long as you call out to me

22:33.450 --> 22:36.540
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.500 --> 22:40.710
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.500 --> 22:40.710
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.420 --> 22:45.460
My only mother

22:41.420 --> 22:45.460
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.460 --> 22:48.550
in this world

22:45.460 --> 22:48.550
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.880 --> 22:51.680
Hug me tightly

22:49.880 --> 22:51.680
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.680 --> 22:53.680
Kiss me gently

22:51.680 --> 22:53.680
Kisu wo shitte sotto

22:53.680 --> 23:01.400
Always be by my side

22:53.680 --> 23:01.400
Itsudemo watashi no soba ni ite ne

23:01.900 --> 23:04.690
On the path lined with chestnut trees

23:01.900 --> 23:04.690
Maronie no michi

23:04.690 --> 23:09.650
we walk hand-in-hand

23:04.690 --> 23:09.650
Futari te wo tori aruku

23:09.650 --> 23:13.370
If we sing together,

23:09.650 --> 23:13.370
Isshoni utaeba

23:13.370 --> 23:17.540
we can have fun with just that.

23:13.370 --> 23:17.540
Tanoshii ne sore dake de

23:17.830 --> 23:21.750
Bathing in the sunlight filtering through the canopy

23:17.830 --> 23:21.750
Komorebi no naka yureru

23:21.750 --> 23:25.750
Your beautiful eyes

23:21.750 --> 23:25.750
Kirei na hitomi

23:25.750 --> 23:29.380
And that gentle smile

23:25.750 --> 23:29.380
Yawaraka na hohoemi de

23:29.380 --> 23:35.060
envelop me.

23:29.380 --> 23:35.060
Watashi wo tsutsumu no

23:39.770 --> 24:09.630
Preview

23:41.240 --> 23:44.550
Hey. you must take Cosette to Fantine as soon as possible!

23:44.910 --> 23:46.180
Photography hasn't been invented yet,

23:46.580 --> 23:48.890
but if they had a picture of Cosette, they
would know that they were deceived!

23:48.910 --> 23:50.730
Those vile Thénardiers!

23:50.750 --> 23:53.730
Mayor Madeleine probably won't have time to pick up Cosette right away!

23:53.750 --> 23:55.730
What, with all this fuss about the fake Jean Valjean being arrested.

23:55.750 --> 23:58.610
and, it looks like Mayor Madeleine will be attending the trial!

23:58.630 --> 24:00.900
Next time, Mayor Madeleine is Perplexed.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.110
It's only natural that he's confused.

24:02.130 --> 24:04.610
To hear that someone has been mistaken for him
and will spend the rest of his life in prison.

24:04.630 --> 24:09.630
Madeleine is Perplexed

24:04.640 --> 24:06.410
Javert could disappear and he can go on with his life.

24:06.430 --> 24:07.910
Quite the pickle, huh? Mayor Madeleine.

24:07.930 --> 24:09.620
I'm perplexed myself!

24:24.650 --> 24:29.730
Look forward to the next Episode!
